    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s267-main-endpoint",
      "source": "sections/s267-main-endpoint.md",
      "source_hash": "ea666cc78d7f96824828a9c2f2106beef598393a7690262c9b07cfc469a62eb8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/pid/identifiers is not implemented; an item's identifiers come from the Items endpoint. POST /api/pid/identifiers?type=<type>, with the item URI as a text/uri-list body, mints and queues a new identifier for an archived item; only DOI is supported for now. It returns the identifier (value, type, status such as TO_BE_REGISTERED). Codes: 201, 400 (bad item or type, or DOI already registered), 401, 403, 404.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
