    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s272-single-request",
      "source": "sections/s272-single-request.md",
      "source_hash": "8213950a923c1a564cf08cf613ef82400a28684861132f72311889448d58521f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/tools/itemrequests/<token> returns one copy request. Its properties are the requested item and bitstream ids, allfiles, the requester's email, name and message, the request, expiry and decision dates, acceptRequest, and the opaque token; id, token and the dates are read-only. Links: item and bitstream. Codes: 200, or 404 for an unknown token.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s273-creating-a-request",
      "source": "sections/s273-creating-a-request.md",
      "source_hash": "f8bcd9c912ba0dfdd0c90292376aabcb0d1e80694094d4505256dba56332f059",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "POST /api/tools/itemrequests lets anyone file a copy request as JSON. itemId is always required; bitstreamId is required unless allfiles is true; requestEmail is required for anonymous sessions, and email and name come from the EPerson when the session is authenticated. The response is empty so the token is not exposed, and an appropriate person is notified. Codes: 201, 401 if anonymous requests are disabled, 422 for an unreadable body, a missing item or bitstream, or missing fields.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s274-accepting-denying-a-request",
      "source": "sections/s274-accepting-denying-a-request.md",
      "source_hash": "6c3da8e05f549ab63891717ae777069ce5f3525238dc78d4c65729cd13b0a4b7",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "PUT /api/tools/itemrequests/<token> accepts or denies a copy request; access is controlled by keeping the token secret. acceptRequest is required. Optional responseMessage, subject and suggestOpenAccess shape the reply to the requester (the last one also asks administrators to open access) and are not stored; requests cannot otherwise be updated. Codes: 200, 401 if anonymous, 403 if the user is not a configured approver, 422 if the request is unknown or acceptRequest is missing.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
