    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s279-main-endpoint",
      "source": "sections/s279-main-endpoint.md",
      "source_hash": "bb999828c65ac369b6fa7541a41acf71ec8a206aaa7a1fed3ac469fd480e3977",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items lists items from the database and is meant for administrators; users normally reach items through search or browse. It currently returns only archived, non-withdrawn items; withdrawn, workspace and workflow items are found through search, and template items through their collection. A later change may include all items (DSpace issue 3325).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s280-single-item",
      "source": "sections/s280-single-item.md",
      "source_hash": "284ed680c0a660290c50b95947f35a95bf16388430de4c8331b4476038d4dca3",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid> returns one item: uuid, name, handle, a metadata map keyed by schema.element.qualifier with ordered values, and the flags inArchive, discoverable and withdrawn. Administrative metadata can be hidden by configuration, and a withdrawn item shows its metadata only to administrators. Links: bundles, owningCollection, mappedCollections, templateItemOf, relationships, thumbnail. A warning notes that the per-value place field may be dropped in favour of array order (issue 7582). Codes: 200, 401, 403, 404.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s281-withdrawn-item",
      "source": "sections/s281-withdrawn-item.md",
      "source_hash": "b20be5a8d5cf7fef5b47b6f5c85e8f61db343fe311aa343cf3d36a68c492f447",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A withdrawn item is a normal item retired by a patch operation. Once withdrawn, its response shows an empty metadata map to everyone except administrators, with inArchive false and withdrawn true, as the example shows.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s282-creating-an-archived-item",
      "source": "sections/s282-creating-an-archived-item.md",
      "source_hash": "8dd4f7ae330fe496fd0a945d8a2f0321160e1e4ef73db4003f7ae6e306f87e72",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "POST /api/core/items?owningCollection=<uuid> lets administrators create an archived item directly, bypassing the workflow, from a JSON body with name, metadata and the inArchive, discoverable and withdrawn flags.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s283-creating-an-archived-item-from-an-external-sourc",
      "source": "sections/s283-creating-an-archived-item-from-an-external-sourc.md",
      "source_hash": "a8a9107715a884ea11b0e544900793581f324b84fc2238dd56f8fc8fb102e861",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The same POST /api/core/items?owningCollection=<uuid> call, sent with a text/uri-list body, lets administrators create an archived item from an external source: the body holds one external entry value (for example an ORCID record) whose metadata is imported. More than one entry gives 400.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s284-updating-item-metadata",
      "source": "sections/s284-updating-item-metadata.md",
      "source_hash": "85963b33a461d3237bf718e45da84edc7351af1536a9b892a6720a13b4ff7e65",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "PUT /api/core/items/<uuid> replaces an item's metadata with the JSON sent and returns the updated item.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s285-patch-operations",
      "source": "sections/s285-patch-operations.md",
      "source_hash": "f3ec6b5315343764ed11209f2a8a8d9c0b8ae740f101bbcb8d96ea17a6dacff4",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Item metadata is changed by PATCH as described in Modifying metadata via Patch; a few further item properties can be patched as the following sections describe.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s286-replace",
      "source": "sections/s286-replace.md",
      "source_hash": "cb9046f72444c94b2eec35d1730a652ae348e65565c71e90a86210105eaed571",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The PATCH replace operation changes only existing values; using it on an uninitialised value is an error. Replacing /withdrawn with true withdraws an item (inArchive becomes false), with false reinstates it (inArchive becomes true), and replacing /discoverable with false makes an item private. Each needs an Authorization header; curl examples and before and after states are given.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s287-linked-entities",
      "source": "sections/s287-linked-entities.md",
      "source_hash": "6281a63dd06a33cc5a9c35a46a9343b8183193eb7e3ab9c28f452786a2095925",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Heading for the linked entities of an item; no text beyond the heading.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s288-access-status",
      "source": "sections/s288-access-status.md",
      "source_hash": "fb67be3298ffdd0d84f1a0fd0c2fe36246a21e554cd143c9989b600c747f6213",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/accessStatus returns an item's computed access status. The default values are metadata.only (no primary file), open.access, embargo, restricted and unknown, computed from the policies of the primary file, or of the first file in the ORIGINAL bundle if none is marked primary. Codes: 200, 400 for an invalid UUID, 404 if the item cannot be retrieved.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s289-bundles",
      "source": "sections/s289-bundles.md",
      "source_hash": "b8812f0e8e06fede6dd08767642b8c42b19df50b5b4a08ad3a3f0d0e289c4103",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/bundles returns an item's bundles (such as ORIGINAL and THUMBNAIL), which is how a client gets only one kind of bitstream or reorders a bundle. POST to the same path with a name and metadata creates a new bundle and returns it. Codes: 201, 400 if the bundle name already exists, 401, 403, 404, and 412 on a size or checksum mismatch.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s290-owning-collection",
      "source": "sections/s290-owning-collection.md",
      "source_hash": "3e5aef6beca9d3b5c51b5b9e895812531e53471cbec07ad8062baa1f4b264360",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/owningCollection returns the item's owning collection, and PUT with a collection URI moves the item there (inheritPolicies=true also copies the target's policies); 204 on success. mappedCollections lists the other collections an item is mapped into. POST a collection URI to add a mapping and DELETE .../mappedCollections/<collection_uuid> to remove one, both 204 even as a no-op; PUT and deleting all mappings at once are unsupported. Errors include 405 for template items and 422 for an unknown collection or the owning collection.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s291-template-item",
      "source": "sections/s291-template-item.md",
      "source_hash": "a9678ae211a49373c47bfd37bc078a20025e7ebf8d800b29b844d4f47d0ed83f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/templateItemOf returns the collection that uses the item as its template.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s292-relationships-per-item",
      "source": "sections/s292-relationships-per-item.md",
      "source_hash": "31db75f15c53eb9fdf293d77ff165ae41f2b1c3320b851143a3fba043a48d15d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/relationships embeds every relationship in which the item is either the left or the right item.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
