    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s293-main-thumbnail",
      "source": "sections/s293-main-thumbnail.md",
      "source_hash": "072b3370ce760cf262a99cfbee11ebd97504dead45a7f3259f8ef294effc5401",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<uuid>/thumbnail returns the bitstream that is the item's main thumbnail. Codes: 200, 204 if there is no thumbnail, 401, 403, 404.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s294-get-single-version-for-item",
      "source": "sections/s294-get-single-version-for-item.md",
      "source_hash": "93867d9a255df2310e984981a47d2b2a7868e73d04a4e377c43e6bb34199685c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<item-uuid>/version returns the single version an item belongs to, in the same form as the Version endpoint. Read permission on the item and the version permissions are both checked. Codes: 200, 204 if the item is not versioned, 400 for a bad UUID, 401 and 403 when versioning is not public.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s295-get-item-identifiers",
      "source": "sections/s295-get-item-identifiers.md",
      "source_hash": "b1b3e98064fd994dedb19cb6783404ba8fc334242bb8486f85def9e4320ca51f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "GET /api/core/items/<item-uuid>/identifiers returns the identifiers attached to an item, such as its DOI and handle, each with its type and, where relevant, its status. It uses the same data model as the identifiers submission step. Codes: 200, 400, 401, 403, 404.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s296-deleting-an-item",
      "source": "sections/s296-deleting-an-item.md",
      "source_hash": "577c88d89cacf7969248c6ac50650c967ae530dd9a45c8c179b17884142ab645",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "DELETE /api/core/items/<uuid> deletes an item. The administrator-only copyVirtualMetadata parameter copies virtual metadata into related items before deletion: all, specific relationship type ids (repeatable), configured (taken from configuration), or none when absent. Codes: 204, 401, 403, 404.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7RqsTp9ABmR5SJCth"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
